  "title": "B-Roll: Special Forces Mobilize for Hurricane Milton Search and Rescue Operations",
  "description": "Soldiers assigned to the 3rd Battalion, 20th Special Forces Group mobilized from Cecil Airport in Jacksonville, Florida, Oct. 10, 2024. The unit is airlifting equipment and personnel to assist with search and rescue operations following the impact of Hurricane Milton in South Florida. The Florida National Guard has Soldiers and Airmen mobilized throughout the state to assist local communities as they come together during this response. (U.S. Air Force video by Senior Airman Thomas S. Keisler IV)",
